title: "Three Rulers, One Dataset: an audit of MovieLens 25M"
abstract: "An end-to-end audit of MovieLens 25M (25,000,095 ratings, 1995-2019): every documented invariant holds exactly, and the 25-year series is three rating instruments stitched at undocumented seams."
